  "globalAtomicityInvariants": [
    "New workpaper creation requires independently verified CREATE_WORKPAPER_IN_ENGAGEMENT authority scoped to its parent engagement; no preexisting workpaper ID or its own newly created grant can bootstrap creation",
    "Refusal must not change revision text or counters, evidence references, signoffs, supersessions, review note state/event history, workflow state/events or audit events",
    "Refusal cannot fall back to the old unflagged create_workpaper_revision path or another registered write command",
    "Read-only historical list/export views must remain available under separately approved preservation policy",
    "Trusted actor identity must be resolved natively, never from actorId, actorRole, raisedBy or ownerId alone",
    "Test fixtures must not create a real issuer, workpaper grants or a fake human security approver",
    "A newly created workpaper cannot be born REVIEWED or professionally approved solely from a caller-supplied workflowState, and creation grants do not implicitly grant its owner review or approval rights"
  ],
